TI  - A Novel Design Method of Monitoring and Control System for Office Environment Based on WIFI Communication, Internet and Cloud Platform
T2  - 2016 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE AND ENGINEERING (ESE 2016)
CP  - International Conference on Environmental Science and Engineering (ESE)
AB  - For the office are constructed and decorated with more and more luxurious, and the large amount of office electronic equipment are being used, therefore many kinds of harmful ingredients are releasing, which will damage people's physical and mental health. In order to measure the value of harmful ingredient in the office, this paper introduces a novel monitoring and control system and method for office environment based on WIFI communication, internet and cloud platform. In this system and method, most of parameters of the ingredients in the office can be monitored and changed with the special intelligent terminals at the same time. These parameters are converted to data records after digital filtering in the terminal and sent to cloud server in time. This system can make a statistic, analysis, query and browse the data records of the office environment for the user by the computer or mobile devices anywhere.
